          "charspan": [
            0,
            622
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "ISSAQUAH, Wash., August  16,  2023  -  Costco  Wholesale  Corporation  ('Costco'  or  the  'Company')  (Nasdaq:  COST)  today  announced  the election to its Board of Directors of Helena Buonanno Foulkes. Most recently, Ms. Foulkes was CEO of Hudson's Bay Company. Previously she spent 25 years at CVS Health, including as President of CVS Pharmacy and Executive Vice President of CVS Health. Ms. Foulkes is also a member of the boards of directors of Follett  Higher  Education,  PM  Pediatrics,  Harry's  Inc.,  and  Skillsoft.  She  recently  completed  a  term  as President of Harvard University's Board of Overseers.",
      "text": "ISSAQUAH, Wash., August  16,  2023  -  Costco  Wholesale  Corporation  ('Costco'  or  the  'Company')  (Nasdaq:  COST)  today  announced  the election to its Board of Directors of Helena Buonanno Foulkes. Most recently, Ms. Foulkes was CEO of Hudson's Bay Company. Previously she spent 25 years at CVS Health, including as President of CVS Pharmacy and Executive Vice President of CVS Health. Ms. Foulkes is also a member of the boards of directors of Follett  Higher  Education,  PM  Pediatrics,  Harry's  Inc.,  and  Skillsoft.  She  recently  completed  a  term  as President of Harvard University's Board of Overseers."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/50",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
        {
          "page_no": 3,
          "bbox": {
            "l": 18.225,
            "t": 548.02,
            "r": 593.999,
            "b": 521.484,
            "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            359
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "Hamilton (Tony) James, Chairman of the Board, stated: \"We are very pleased to welcome Helena as a member of our Board. She is widely recognized  as  a  leading  retail  executive  and  advocate  for  education.  She  also  brings  substantial  experience  in  healthcare  and  as  a  board member of prominent companies. We look forward to her contributions.\"",
      "text": "Hamilton (Tony) James, Chairman of the Board, stated: \"We are very pleased to welcome Helena as a member of our Board. She is widely recognized  as  a  leading  retail  executive  and  advocate  for  education.  She  also  brings  substantial  experience  in  healthcare  and  as  a  board member of prominent companies. We look forward to her contributions.\""
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/51",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
